            <div xml:id="d500">

                <pb facs="0569" n="557" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg557"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.34553B/5a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Chargé in Portugal</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kennan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-10-19T13:00:00-04:00">October 19, 1943—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1816. Your 2449, October 18, 8 p.m., has been shown to the President who has
                    directed me to state that a brief delay in opening negotiations will have no
                    damaging effect from our point of view. He sees no reason however for your
                    return here but wishes you to submit your views in full by cable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
